{"lines":[{"w":0.30390144348144532,"y":0.0058139530575510578,"h":0.033430233395556841,"c":1,"t":"@MirsIELTS","x":0.0082135492068117818},{"w":0.12114990234375,"h":0.014534883302221635,"t":"Audioscripts","c":1,"x":0.090349073356240622,"y":0.049418604846541259},{"w":0.55236139933268225,"t":"Since I started, I've had to deal with a range of emergency situations.","h":0.016069835899150453,"c":1,"x":0.092402464733042769,"y":0.094395280062302911},{"h":0.014568326606863025,"c":1,"t":"But the work's hugely motivating. It's not just about saving lives - I've learned a lot about the","x":0.09240246820371377,"w":0.73305953979492189,"y":0.11769911504177588},{"w":0.72895278930664065,"h":0.016224188790560423,"c":1,"t":"technology involved. My background in IT's been useful here, and I can use my expertise to","x":0.09034906728118311,"y":0.13362831872482961},{"x":0.090349085739263924,"y":0.14970930253275982,"w":0.71047225952148441,"c":1,"t":"help other volunteers. They're a great group - we're like a family really, which helps when","h":0.014597482034238718},{"x":0.090349080401703738,"y":0.16424418616037384,"w":0.74127309163411459,"h":0.015991802271840161,"t":"you're dragging yourself out of bed on a cold stormy night. But actually, it's the colder months","c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.18023255825503204,"w":0.73305953979492178,"x":0.090349080103702406,"t":"that can be the most rewarding time. That's when the incidents tend to be more serious, and","h":0.015988371857499684},{"y":0.19485057060393485,"w":0.51553380330403653,"t":"you realise that you can make a huge difference to the outcome.","h":0.015940814172975437,"c":1,"x":0.090290425310597722},{"x":0.092402465830464284,"w":0.34702257792154945,"h":0.013110550174319169,"c":1,"y":0.21799410046950141,"t":"So if any of you listeners are interested. ..."},{"y":0.14534883730041681,"w":0.067761809031168574,"t":"Q19\/20","h":0.015988371857499684,"c":1,"x":0.85831622064184221},{"x":0.092378119921564944,"t":"PART 3","w":0.10271809260050455,"y":0.27607612468326193,"h":0.014708215719127393,"c":1},{"w":0.051334702173868804,"x":0.090349076402798642,"t":"BELLA:","y":0.30523255838672536,"h":0.011627906191665538,"c":1},{"h":0.0087209302063888661,"c":1,"w":0.034907598495483402,"x":0.09240246348326446,"t":"DON.","y":0.32267441859208601},{"x":0.09032267865877347,"h":0.011740510653605485,"c":1,"w":0.04933410962422688,"y":0.33569951197064851,"t":"BELLA:"},{"y":0.35319767430830173,"x":0.092402463548539912,"c":1,"h":0.010174418761666915,"w":0.036960986455281578,"t":"DON:"},{"t":"BELLA:","c":1,"x":0.090349076402798642,"y":0.39680232571882468,"w":0.051334702173868804,"h":0.013081394746943587},{"h":0.010174418761666804,"c":1,"t":"DON:","x":0.0924024634896813,"y":0.41424418593620871,"w":0.034907598495483402},{"x":0.090349076239987267,"y":0.42877907004370219,"w":0.049281314214070629,"h":0.011627906191665538,"t":"BELLA:","c":1},{"w":0.039014371236165357,"t":"DON:","x":0.090349077446599035,"h":0.013081394746943698,"c":1,"y":0.44476744199789442},{"w":0.049281314214070629,"y":0.4752906979506788,"x":0.090349076239987267,"h":0.011627906191665538,"t":"BELLA:","c":1},{"x":0.090349077406990927,"c":1,"w":0.036960983276367196,"h":0.013081394746943587,"t":"DON:","y":0.5058139536258015},{"y":0.53614829868934843,"w":0.049478979110717761,"t":"BELLA:","x":0.090250243793652443,"c":1,"h":0.013459216317595946},{"x":0.090349075458190833,"t":"DON:","w":0.036960986455281578,"y":0.58430232547462524,"h":0.010174418761666804,"c":1},{"y":0.59863727507069164,"h":0.010574286806899869,"x":0.090268180937211326,"c":1,"w":0.049443105061848971,"t":"BELLA:"},{"x":0.092402465319128213,"h":0.010174418761666915,"y":0.64534883702905022,"w":0.034907595316569007,"c":1,"t":"DON:"},{"t":"BELLA:","y":0.67569502382750279,"h":0.011982045131446961,"c":1,"w":0.051492602030436194,"x":0.088216738305545703},{"c":1,"t":"DON:","x":0.090349075619528471,"y":0.69186046486312214,"h":0.011627907316944963,"w":0.036960986455281578},{"x":0.088269023415555092,"w":0.051388031641642268,"c":1,"y":0.72232446794908578,"t":"BELLA:","h":0.01174641274421262},{"t":"BELLA:","x":0.090349078089540263,"w":0.049281311035156261,"h":0.010174418761666915,"c":1,"y":0.77616279044959302},{"c":1,"h":0.008720930206388755,"w":0.034907598495483402,"t":"DON:","y":0.80813953487115586,"x":0.09240246348326446},{"t":"BELLA:","y":0.83866279069180061,"w":0.049281314214070629,"h":0.0087209302063888661,"x":0.090349075854307417,"c":1},{"y":0.87063953487115586,"h":0.008720930206388755,"x":0.090349075464230211,"w":0.036960986455281564,"c":1,"t":"DON:"},{"w":0.64065709431966145,"h":0.015988371857499573,"c":1,"x":0.18891169929602142,"t":"Hi Don - did you get the copy of the article on recycling footwear that I emailed you?","y":0.30377906987880832},{"w":0.31622177124023437,"h":0.014538313716562223,"y":0.31976401165063395,"t":"Yeah - it's here... I've had a look at it.","x":0.18685831345448917,"c":1},{"t":"So do you think it's a good topic for our presentation?","h":0.017433745460172734,"x":0.18677983943127402,"w":0.42730356852213541,"c":1,"y":0.33411170910698451},{"c":1,"y":0.35024545084261327,"h":0.016687393188476562,"x":0.18679150871170408,"t":"Well, before I started reading it, I thought recycling footwear, well, although it's","w":0.62230005900065111},{"h":0.014546888908453792,"c":1,"t":"quite interesting, perhaps there isn't enough to say about it, cos we put shoes in","x":0.18685832303747893,"y":0.36627906995949266,"w":0.63655029296874999},{"x":0.18470767003088487,"w":0.46424809773763021,"h":0.017441306775298426,"c":1,"t":"recycling bins, they go to charity shops and that's about it.","y":0.3801927680644378},{"y":0.39823008876622945,"x":0.18891170181677505,"t":"... but there's much more to it than that.","c":1,"h":0.01179941002949858,"w":0.32443532307942702},{"c":1,"x":0.18875167358008629,"w":0.46437510172526042,"y":0.41129738987334541,"h":0.015444070259026721,"t":"I realise that now and I'm keen to research the topic more."},{"t":"That's great.","h":0.013502414669610774,"x":0.18680562251676208,"c":1,"w":0.10277479171752929,"y":0.42856856009356914},{"c":1,"t":"One of the things I didn't realise until I read the article was just how many pairs of","x":0.19096510008030018,"y":0.44331395322458955,"w":0.64476384480794269,"h":0.013081395872222901},{"w":0.17248460133870441,"x":0.18685831524316848,"t":"trainers get recycled!","h":0.014545173419963753,"c":1,"y":0.45929203566425159},{"w":0.61820877075195324,"c":1,"x":0.18677660842437432,"h":0.017405998882642493,"t":"Well, a lot of young people wear them all the time now. They've become more","y":0.47378957897139529},{"c":1,"t":"popular than ordinary shoes.","x":0.18878177272259677,"y":0.48866735520374482,"w":0.22616907755533855,"h":0.014809421100447695},{"y":0.50581395360339609,"h":0.016014954896099831,"t":"Iknow. I guess they are very hard-wearing, but don't they look a bit casual for","c":1,"x":0.1868583231131086,"w":0.62012318929036458},{"c":1,"t":"school uniform? I don't think they're right for that.","x":0.18685831438893663,"y":0.52034883737943527,"w":0.39014373779296874,"h":0.013081394746943475},{"t":"Actually, I think some of them look quite smart on pupils... better than a scruffy","h":0.014588906842347038,"c":1,"y":0.5362831859691638,"w":0.6365502929687501,"x":0.1868583236374774},{"w":0.13963039398193361,"h":0.011799410029498469,"y":0.55221238935173289,"c":1,"t":"old pair of shoes.","x":0.18891170222097614},{"w":0.28364461263020835,"t":"So do you keep shoes a long time?","y":0.5653520059955518,"c":1,"h":0.017298390098729244,"x":0.18673400175344237},{"c":1,"y":0.58136610017445267,"h":0.017363789651246186,"w":0.64695393880208329,"t":"Yes. Though I do tend to wear my old pairs for doing dirty jobs like cleaning my bike.","x":0.18679030827172557},{"c":1,"w":0.63255442301432296,"h":0.016493655517038075,"t":"I must admit, I've recycled some perfectly good shoes, that haven't gone out of","x":0.18474841794799118,"y":0.59735968812782059},{"y":0.61327433626750583,"c":1,"w":0.61396306355794272,"x":0.18685830384034507,"h":0.014749262536873142,"t":"fashion and still fit, just because they don't look great on me any more. That's"},{"w":0.10677618662516275,"h":0.011642484749312954,"y":0.62936046493164388,"x":0.18685831318125845,"t":"awful isn't it?","c":1},{"y":0.64267044462438205,"w":0.60389943440755212,"c":1,"t":"I think it's common because there's so much choice. The article did say that","h":0.016637216978720115,"x":0.1867452833555894},{"t":"recent sales of footwear have increased enormously.","h":0.014930509044005835,"w":0.42117538452148445,"x":0.18677559020484197,"c":1,"y":0.65812254074496135},{"h":0.015558809376044369,"w":0.19152559916178385,"c":1,"t":"That didn't surprise me.","x":0.18658577847562141,"y":0.67429988741901548},{"y":0.69026548656598596,"t":"No. But then it said that the amount of recycled footwear has fallen: it's 6 percent","w":0.62833674112955729,"h":0.014749262536873142,"x":0.18685832336606797,"c":1},{"w":0.64476384480794269,"h":0.011627907316944963,"t":"now compared to a previous level of 11 percent. That doesn't seem to make sense.","c":1,"y":0.70639534866454767,"x":0.18891171199887252},{"t":"That's because not everything goes through the recycling process. Some footwear","w":0.64281885782877601,"y":0.72089867327284596,"x":0.18680121838363684,"h":0.015740767622416052,"c":1},{"h":0.013126843657817133,"c":1,"x":0.18685831619107754,"t":"just isn't good enough to re-sell, for one reason or another, and gets rejected.","y":0.73687315660113906,"w":0.60164271036783856},{"t":"So let's find some examples in the article of footwear that was rejected for","c":1,"w":0.58521560668945316,"h":0.011799410029498469,"y":0.77610619459657415,"x":0.18891170373649716},{"x":0.18475644920221665,"t":"recycling.","y":0.79055916665112425,"h":0.014811898965751191,"c":1,"w":0.08223248163859051},{"w":0.62012318929036458,"y":0.80668604671848476,"t":"OK. I think there are some in the interview with the recycling manager. Yeah -","x":0.1868583231134493,"h":0.014552891148930103,"c":1},{"y":0.82100354743767145,"w":0.076105791727701849,"t":"here it is.","h":0.0120626725278421,"x":0.18679309990523643,"c":1},{"y":0.8371681414983122,"t":"Mmm. Let's start with the ladies' high-heeled shoes. What did he say","w":0.54620122273763028,"h":0.014576044335829486,"c":1,"x":0.18685832075776224},{"t":"about those?","c":1,"w":0.10472279230753581,"x":0.18891170437073887,"y":0.85309734497775314,"h":0.010324483775811188},{"t":"He said they were probably expensive - the material was suede and they were","h":0.013093400353175744,"y":0.86773255827696427,"x":0.18685831364353409,"w":0.62628336588541667,"c":1},{"x":0.18891170496246909,"w":0.62628336588541667,"t":"beige in colour - it looked like someone had only worn them once, but in a very","y":0.88372092996697205,"h":0.013081395872223012,"c":1},{"w":0.59137578328450524,"c":1,"t":"wet field so the heels were too stained with mud and grass to re-sell them.","h":0.013085683186848884,"y":0.8997050147467176,"x":0.18685830948351548},{"y":0.36773255839687713,"w":0.036960986455281564,"c":1,"t":"Q21","h":0.013081394746943475,"x":0.85831622125558982},{"x":0.85831622125478457,"w":0.036960986455281564,"t":"Q22","c":1,"h":0.013081394746943475,"y":0.50872093049503031},{"c":1,"t":"Q23","w":0.03696098327636721,"h":0.013081394746943587,"x":0.8583162231462107,"y":0.59593023269556888},{"w":0.036960986455281564,"c":1,"x":0.85831622125478457,"y":0.6904069770066581,"t":"Q24","h":0.013081394746943587},{"c":1,"y":0.89754407495556709,"h":0.016178890667130408,"w":0.041393473943074577,"t":"Q25","x":0.85525738093693138},{"x":0.090349075464230211,"h":0.013081394746943587,"t":"106","y":0.92296511654154179,"w":0.036960986455281564,"c":1},{"t":"IELTSXpress.com","w":0.45294118245442705,"x":0.51176470218665204,"y":0.94166666659226195,"h":0.04166666666666663,"c":1}],"w":2400,"h":3390}